description: |-
  Diagnoses syslog collector failures on a Broker VM by checking broker status and fetching errors within a specified lookback period.
  Returns the overall diagnostic status (HEALTHY, WARNING or ERROR) and a detailed diagnosis report with the 10 latest discovered errors.
